name: "HWE-ND"
displayName: "Howling Winds Of Exedite"
author: "Starroyo"
description: "A expedition to outer space has resulted
in a catastrophic accident, rendering all previous technology lost, in your local part
of the stars, you are too far to start communications with the two planets you have recently
conquered, and your core, trashed and destroyed, repaired only by the scraps of your
former resources, is now wholly unrecognizable compared to its original form.

Explore the new planet Exedite which, is very simple and basic
for a mod, currently Exedite has not been implemented yet, technologies
can be only found in Sandbox.

Offshoot of another mod i made for a different game, known as
Nexum Disicuntio, this doesnt not take place in Nexun Disicuntio's timeline
however, though mentions of it will be present.

Credits to
Starray / Vack / Starroyo - Creator of the mod."
version: "1.0"
minGameVersion: "150.1"
